// Interface strings — English (CLAUDE.md "Language and localisation").
//
// The key sets of `pl.ron` and `en.ron` **must be identical**; the test
// `klucze_obu_jezykow_sa_identyczne` in `engine/ui` enforces it. A missing key breaks
// the build, because a silent fallback to the other language only surfaces for players.
//
// `One` is a string without a numeral, `Plural` carries every form of *this* language:
// two in English, three in Polish. Placeholders in braces are matched by name.
